From f26b6fa70be8c04c554a8129b9d43fffb089139e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Work Leaf Bench <bench@example.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 06:25:15 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ADD terminal visual yank modes so pane text can be copied
 from the UI

Visual character, line, and block modes reuse the rendered left and right pane caches so selections match what the user sees. Yanking stores the selected text in TerminalUi and emits an OSC 52 clipboard update on the next render, with terminal app and harness input parsing covering Ctrl-V and visual escape handling.
